1
00:00:00,473 --> 00:00:03,643
(Sheldon:)Because I'd like to erase Ben Affleck
as Daredevil.

2
00:00:06,813 --> 00:00:08,853
(Howard:)So would Ben Affleck.

3
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:13,150
(Howard:)The point is, in a situation like this,
you gotta pick sides.

4
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,530
(Howard:)You're either on team Leonard
or team Penny.

5
00:00:16,698 --> 00:00:19,538
(Sheldon:)-Which one picks last?
-What?

6
00:00:19,701 --> 00:00:21,831
(Sheldon:)Usually, I'm on the team
that picks last.

7
00:00:23,205 --> 00:00:25,585
(Sheldon:)Unless there's a kid in a wheelchair.

8
00:00:28,585 --> 00:00:30,585
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I got you
your tangerine chicken.

9
00:00:30,754 --> 00:00:32,544
(Leonard:)I hope you're hungry.

10
00:00:33,548 --> 00:00:35,548
(Sheldon:)Well, of course I'm hungry.

11
00:00:35,717 --> 00:00:38,387
(Sheldon:)And as I have no plans
to eat with any other team...

12
00:00:38,553 --> 00:00:41,933
(Sheldon:)...I will consume my tangerine chicken
with the appropriate gusto.

13
00:00:42,098 --> 00:00:43,558
(Sheldon:)Mm, mm, mm.

14
00:00:46,019 --> 00:00:47,099
(Penny:)Okay.

15
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:49,860
(Sheldon:)Just out of curiosity,
do we still have hot dogs?

16
00:00:50,565 --> 00:00:51,815
(Leonard:)I don't know. Why?

17
00:00:52,025 --> 00:00:54,445
(Sheldon:)Just making dinner conversation.

18
00:00:54,611 --> 00:00:57,031
(Sheldon:)Go team Leonard.

